Add opt-in --verification-cache DIR for persistent per-task solver exchanges.
Exact task inputs, ordered UsedTypes, execution options and native dependency
identities guard reuse. Completed valid results and resource-bounded errors or
resource exhaustion retain their resource counts; replayed log timings are marked.
Unsupported profiles, corrupt entries and divergent replay execute normally.
Linux dependency closure follows loaded native images and the selected solver; unused optional runtime providers do not require unrelated system packages.
